nt": "Instructions: Find the words in the word search below. Click the first letter and the last letter of the word to select it.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le17ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le17ob11re2img08.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le17ob11re2img08.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn6le17ob11re2img08.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi Sally!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Hi Vanessa!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  You've been busy writing articles on leisure activities and entertainment! I eagerly read them all.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Which hobby is for you?", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn6le17ob11re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not sure. I learned a lot about kite-flying. It seems to be such a peaceful activity. I have always wanted to try it. Have you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, I flew a couple of kites. People love talking about their original creations. I spoke to a few prize winners. They proudly answered all my questions. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How did you get the idea about dancing?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I have gone ballroom dancing, so basically, I know a bit about different dances like the foxtrot and the cha-cha.  I have never tried the waltz. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I would rather try the samba.", "id": 2, "time": "11000"}, {"image": "engenn6le17ob11re2img08.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Me too! You should try some of the sports like parachuting or hang gliding!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not sure about that!  They seem like fun, but they're too dangerous for me.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I guess they are. Canoeing would be a safer bet.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Stamp collecting is even safer!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, philatelists have it easy.", "id": 3, "time": "43000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Leisure Time", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Which Hobby Is for You?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "  Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}, {"content": "", "type": "secondary_9"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "basically", "type": "name"}, {"content": "generally; for the most part", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have done some ballroom dancing, so basically, I know a bit about dance. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "leisure activity", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you do in your free time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You've been busy writing articles on leisure activities! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "kite-flying", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the activity of flying a kite", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I learned a lot about kite-flying.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ballroom dancing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a series of popular dances between two people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have done some ballroom dancing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "entertainment", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a performance  people enjoy watching", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What form of entertainment do you prefer?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hang gliding", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an activity in which you move through the air hanging from a flying apparatus", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you want to try some of the sports like hang gliding?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "philatelist", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who collects stamps", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Philatelists have it easy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Present Perfect and Simple Past", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a finished action or event that is connected to the present in some way. <br><br>You use the Simple Past tense to talk about a finished action or event <span class=\"strong\">not</span> necessarily connected to the present.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the Present Perfect tense to talk about experience. When you use the Present Perfect tense, you think about the past and present together. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li><span class=\"italic\">I have learned English</span>  = I learned English in the past and now I can speak English.</li>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li><span class=\"italic\">He has bought a painting</span> = He bought the painting in the past and now he has a painting. </li>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We use <span class=\"strong\">have/has + the past participle</span> of the verb in Present Perfect sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart about how to form the Present Perfect tense:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"do\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"did\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"done\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I have done ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was, were\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You've been ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"begin\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"began\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"begun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You have begun ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You've been busy writing articles on leisure activities and entertainment!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I have done some ballroom dancing.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use adverbs of manner to describe how something is done.<br>Example: She walked slowly.<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;  How did she walk? Slowly.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Many adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"strong\">-ly</span> to an adjective:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:    \tsad/sadly,           \tcurious/curiously", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You take out the letter -y and add <span class=\"strong\">-ily</span> to adjectives ending in -y.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: angry/angrily", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The adjectives <span class=\"strong\">fast, hard, well</span> and <span class=\"strong\">straight</span> are exceptions.  They do not change when they become adverbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Some adverbs, like <span class=\"italic\">basically</span> or <span class=\"italic\">generally</span>, are often placed at the beginning  of the sentence. You use a comma after the adverb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"eager<Br> proud\\t<br> basic <br> definite\\t<br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"eagerly<br> proudly<br> basically<br> definitely\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I eagerly read all your articles. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: The prize winners proudly answered my all questions. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your partner questions about their interests and hobbies.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask them if they have tried the activities mentioned in this lesson.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make suggestions of new interests and hobbies.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online. Find other hobbies they may be interested in.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles. Your partner asks you questions about what you like to do.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about hobbies.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I research new hobbies online.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I change roles.", "type": "text"}]}]}